papers/112-tournament-score-upset-reversal/HOSTILE_REVIEW_A.md:180:The orbit is `148 -> 4 -> 0 -> 0`, so this tournament has depth two. The exhaustive program reports no failure of idempotence below order six and reports 148 as the least numerical mask at order six when orders and then masks are scanned increasingly. That precise order-dependent statement should replace an unqualified “first witness.”
